[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9362.63, "timestamp": "02:36:02", "text": "比如，嗯，达到盈利目标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9365.27, "timestamp": "02:36:05", "text": "哦，我，我，我能够，我得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9367.19, "timestamp": "02:36:07", "text": "YouTube上的盈利模式，但我是一名"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9374.79, "timestamp": "02:36:14", "text": "是的。我没想到会这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9377.67, "timestamp": "02:36:17", "text": "很多人。我以为是他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9379.75, "timestamp": "02:36:19", "text": "不知为何，那些都是机器人之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9384.309, "timestamp": "02:36:24", "text": "但连续三周都是如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9388.07, "timestamp": "02:36:28", "text": "很多人都像锁门一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9390.87, "timestamp": "02:36:30", "text": "自从在印度以来就一直支持这个直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9392.87, "timestamp": "02:36:32", "text": "对，付款方面的事情确实很麻烦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9395.83, "timestamp": "02:36:35", "text": "对于像PayPal这样的支付方式来说，它不起作用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9399.59, "timestamp": "02:36:39", "text": "与印度人相处是否合适，是印度用户"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9403.429, "timestamp": "02:36:43", "text": "然后观众们也遇到了同样的问题，条纹是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9405.67, "timestamp": "02:36:45", "text": "疼痛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9409.51, "timestamp": "02:36:49", "text": "天哪，我不能说话，暂时联系不上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9411.27, "timestamp": "02:36:51", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9413.75, "timestamp": "02:36:53", "text": "还有什么？我尝试过很多其他方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9416.309, "timestamp": "02:36:56", "text": "选项。那么你就不能使用UPI了，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9418.63, "timestamp": "02:36:58", "text": "如果你使用UPI，它会显示你的真实信息。"}]